  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.48,
      "end": 4.56,
      "text": "You need a human brain robot. If you don't know which one to get, just get the spider.",
      "speech_pct": 94.02
    },
    {
      "start": 4.72,
      "end": 6.56,
      "text": "It's a classic, it's robust.",
      "speech_pct": 98.043
    },
    {
      "start": 9.84,
      "end": 13.04,
      "text": "I know there's a lot of options, but this is a solid one, especially if you're a",
      "speech_pct": 85.875
    },
    {
      "start": 13.04,
      "end": 17.12,
      "text": "beginner. You do gotta grow the brain yourself, but they send you a little thing",
      "speech_pct": 74.314
    },
    {
      "start": 17.12,
      "end": 17.68,
      "text": "for that.",
      "speech_pct": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 18.4,
      "end": 22.8,
      "text": "I don't think people realize I don't think people realize how easy it is to grow",
      "speech_pct": 85.909
    },
    {
      "start": 22.8,
      "end": 26.48,
      "text": "your own human brain cells and put them in a robot.",
      "speech_pct": 87.5
    },
    {
      "start": 40.38,
      "end": 44.22,
      "text": "Human brain computers are so much more powerful than the traditional computers. Like",
      "speech_pct": 89.375
    },
    {
      "start": 44.3,
      "end": 45.5,
      "text": "it's not even close.",
      "speech_pct": 89.333
    },
    {
      "start": 47.42,
      "end": 50.46,
      "text": "You just get the incubator, put him in.",
      "speech_pct": 65.789
    },
    {
      "start": 53.42,
      "end": 57.26,
      "text": "You just get the incubator, let him grow for a month or two, and then put him in",
      "speech_pct": 73.333
    },
    {
      "start": 57.26,
      "end": 59.42,
      "text": "the computing module. You're good to go",
      "speech_pct": 89.63
    },
    {
      "start": 62.41,
      "end": 65.05,
      "text": "That's all it takes. Consistency. I know it sounds",
      "speech_pct": 86.288
    },
    {
      "start": 65.85,
      "end": 71.05,
      "text": "That's all it takes. That's all it takes. Some consistency. I know it sounds cliche,",
      "speech_pct": 71.5
    },
    {
      "start": 71.37,
      "end": 71.93,
      "text": "but really.",
      "speech_pct": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 74.81,
      "end": 75.69,
      "text": "That is",
      "speech_pct": 62.727
    },
    {
      "start": 77.93,
      "end": 79.69,
      "text": "That is all that it takes.",
      "speech_pct": 83.068
    },
    {
      "start": 81.29,
      "end": 85.45,
      "text": "That is all That is all that it takes. I have like 13 of these things in my garage",
      "speech_pct": 93.606
    },
    {
      "start": 85.53,
      "end": 90.25,
      "text": "crawling around. I have like 13 of these things crawling around my garage right now.",
      "speech_pct": 73.432
    },
    {
      "start": 91.03,
      "end": 95.43,
      "text": "Consistency? That really is all that it takes. I have like 13 of these things crawling",
      "speech_pct": 93.5
    },
    {
      "start": 95.51,
      "end": 96.79,
      "text": "in my garage right now.",
      "speech_pct": 92.969
    },
    {
      "start": 101.03,
      "end": 105.59,
      "text": "That's all it takes. Consistency. I know it sounds cliche, but that truly is all",
      "speech_pct": 87.939
    },
    {
      "start": 105.59,
      "end": 109.99,
